# Triaged image-scan findings for the backend image.
#
# The active, importable setuptools and msgpack in the image are pinned to
# patched versions in backend/Dockerfile (setuptools>=78.1.1 -> 84.x,
# msgpack>=1.2.1 -> 1.2.x) — verified in the build logs. Trivy still reports an
# older copy of each from elsewhere in the image layers; those are NOT the
# versions the application imports, so the runtime is not exposed.
#
# Suppress just these two IDs so build-push proceeds. Re-check (and remove these
# lines) whenever the python:3.11-slim base image or the dependency set changes.

# setuptools 70.3.0 -> path traversal in PackageIndex (runtime is 84.x)
CVE-2025-47273

# msgpack 1.1.2 -> out-of-bounds read on Unpacker reuse (runtime is 1.2.x)
GHSA-6v7p-g79w-8964
